e relevant departments of almost all public and private universities in the country have received training. Many of our students are working efficiently in the country and abroad. Engineers from DESA, DESCO, PDB, Palli Bidyut Samity, mobile operator companies, and various factories have received training. Many students have received training in product production and set up factories.<\\/p>\",\"terms_and_condition\":\"ghdjdtghjd\",\"privacy_policy\":\"dtjhgjdjhdj\",\"copyright_text\":\"\\u00a9 2026 Young Technical Training Centre. All rights reserved.\",\"module_center_apply\":\"1\",\"module_student_result\":\"1\",\"module_success_students\":\"1\",\"module_video_gallery\":\"1\",\"module_photo_gallery\":\"1\",\"module_verified_centers\":\"1\",\"module_sponsors\":\"1\",\"module_notice_ticker\":\"1\",\"module_contact_us\":\"1\",\"module_whatsapp\":\"1\",\"primary_color\":\"#7024A8\",\"secondary_color\":\"#581C87\",\"accent_color\":\"#FBBF24\",\"header_logo\":\"public\\\\config\\/kd9tK3CWaqlPvRpUzcdHYTxypz3Pc9lihC7RCCiO.png\"},{\"site_name\":\"BDNSI Technical Training Institute\",\"site_tagline\":\"skill education Quality across Bangladesh\",\"site_rjsc\":\"RJSC-75361\",\"site_phone\":\"09649700002\",\"site_email\":\"info@bdnsi.com\",\"site_address\":\"Dhaka, Bangladesh\",\"twitter_link\":\"#\",\"facebook_link\":\"#\",\"youtube_link\":\"#\",\"linkedin_link\":\"#\",\"notice\":\"\\u09ac\\u09be\\u0982\\u09b2\\u09be\\u09a6\\u09c7\\u09b6 \\u099c\\u09be\\u09a4\\u09c0\\u09af\\u09bc \\u09a6\\u0995\\u09cd\\u09b7\\u09a4\\u09be \\u0987\\u09a8\\u09b8\\u09cd\\u099f\\u09bf\\u099f\\u09bf\\u0989\\u099f \\u098f\\u09b0 \\u09ae\\u09be\\u09a8\\u09b8\\u09ae\\u09cd\\u09ae\\u09a4 \\u09aa\\u09cd\\u09b0\\u09b6\\u09bf\\u0995\\u09cd\\u09b7\\u09a3 \\u0997\\u09cd\\u09b0\\u09b9\\u09a8 \\u0995\\u09b0\\u09c7 \\u0985\\u09a8\\u09c7\\u0995 \\u09b6\\u09bf\\u0995\\u09cd\\u09b7\\u09bf\\u09a4 \\u0995\\u09bf\\u0982\\u09ac\\u09be \\u0985\\u09b0\\u09cd\\u09a7\\u09b6\\u09bf\\u0995\\u09cd\\u09b7\\u09bf\\u09a4 \\u